OL,3,GNEWSAVicar banned for coercive control
OL,4,Aand affair
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vicar has been banned from the
OL,7,Fministry for life after a Church of
OL,8,FEngland tribunal found he had
OL,9,Fcoercively controlled his former wife
OL,10,Fand had a sexual relationship with a
OL,11,Fvulnerable parishioner.
OL,13,FReverend Dr Johnny Douglas was
OL,14,Fsuspended from his position as vicar of
OL,15,FSt Paul's Swanley, Kent, in 2024
OL,16,Ffollowing complaints that were referred
OL,17,Finto the Church of England's formal
OL,18,Fclergy discipline process, the Diocese
OL,19,Fof Rochester said.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
