OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVicar banned for coercive control
OL,4,Aand affair
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tribunal found the 51-year-old had
OL,7,Fsubjected his ex-wife to coercive and
OL,8,Fcontrolling behaviour and had a
OL,9,F"sexually intimate" relationship with
OL,10,Fthe parishioner, referred to as XY.
OL,12,FIn a statement, the diocese said the
OL,13,Findependent disciplinary tribunal had
OL,14,Fimposed a penalty of immediate removal
OL,15,Ffrom office and prohibition from
OL,16,Fministry for life, and that the
OL,17,Fdecision remained subject to an
OL,18,Fapplication for leave to appeal.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
